Modifications (also marked in each file header and at the changed code):

  RestartClassLoader.getResources(String)
    The original returns only the parent's resources because DevTools keeps the
    restart URLs on the parent classpath too. In this project the child URLs are
    not on the parent classpath, so the loader's own resources (findResources) are
    returned first, followed by the parent's. Without this, classpath*: component
    scanning in the child context finds nothing.

  SnapshotStateRepository
    Removed the STATIC constant, which referenced StaticSnapshotStateRepository
    (a DevTools class that was not copied).

